# Cloudflare Pages redirects
# https://developers.cloudflare.com/pages/configuration/redirects/

# NOTE: www -> apex cannot be done in this file. Cloudflare Pages only accepts
# relative paths here, so any absolute "https://www..." rule is skipped at deploy.
# Handle it in the Cloudflare dashboard instead, either by:
#   1. adding www.falknermsheritage.com as a second custom domain on this Pages
#      project (it will serve the same site), or
#   2. Rules -> Redirect Rules on the falknermsheritage.com zone, redirecting
#      hostname equals www.falknermsheritage.com to https://falknermsheritage.com/${path}
# Option 2 is preferred: it keeps one canonical hostname for search engines.

